doc:Factsabstract1_1 schema1:text "This paper addresses the problem of ensuring the continuous operation of cyber-physical systems under conditions of component degradation and wear; proposes proactive prognostics and health management focused on proactive control of technical condition; generates control actions to extend remaining useful life using an RUL prediction model and genetic algorithm optimization; validated on the XJTU-SY Bearing test rig and a bearing-degradation dataset." .
_:ab770ccbaf276e3be82dcd799e9f8ee0 rdf:reifies <<( doc:Factsabstract1_1 schema1:text "This paper addresses the problem of ensuring the continuous operation of cyber-physical systems under conditions of component degradation and wear; proposes proactive prognostics and health management focused on proactive control of technical condition; generates control actions to extend remaining useful life using an RUL prediction model and genetic algorithm optimization; validated on the XJTU-SY Bearing test rig and a bearing-degradation dataset." )>> ;
